{"name":"N'Jast","status":"ok","title":"N'Jast","pageId":140923,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_N%27Jast\" title=\"Category:Maps of N'Jast\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">N'Jast</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Lands\" title=\"Cold Lands\">Cold Lands</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Village</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nar_(ethnicity)\" title=\"Nar (ethnicity)\">Nar</a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Humans\" title=\"Humans\">humans</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"languages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Languages</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Naric\" title=\"Naric\">Naric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Damaran_language\" title=\"Damaran language\">Damaran</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-RoF-p107_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RoF-p107-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500 in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>N'Jast</b> was a village in <a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a> that sat at the crossroads of the <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Road_(Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn)\" title=\"Long Road (Northeast Faerûn)\">Long Road</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Road\" title=\"Cold Road\">Cold Road</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/N%27Jast?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>N'Jast lay in central Narfell. It was east of <a href=\"/wiki/Jiyyd\" title=\"Jiyyd\">Jiyyd</a> and south of the <a href=\"/wiki/Teardrops\" title=\"Teardrops\">Teardrops</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-map_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-map-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-map_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-map-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/N%27Jast?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The village was predominantly a trade outpost. Merchants on the Long Road came from <a href=\"/wiki/Damara\" title=\"Damara\">Damara</a> in the west and <a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a> in the east, while merchants on the <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Road\" title=\"Cold Road\">Cold Road</a> came from the settlements and <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">dwarfholds</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Icerim_Mountains\" title=\"Icerim Mountains\">Icerim Mountains</a> to the north and <a href=\"/wiki/Thesk\" title=\"Thesk\">Thesk</a> to the south.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS-map_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS-map-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-map_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-map-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>It was an important stopover for both merchants and <a class=\"mw-disambig\" href=\"/wiki/Nar\" title=\"Nar\">Nars</a> heading to the <a href=\"/wiki/Bildoobaris\" title=\"Bildoobaris\">Bildoobaris</a> trademeet.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/N%27Jast?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of the mid-to-late 14<sup>th</sup> century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, N'Jast was little more than a <a href=\"/wiki/Waymeet_(Narfell)\" title=\"Waymeet (Narfell)\">waymeet</a>,<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TBL-map_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TBL-map-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> but it had become a permanent settlement by the late 15<sup>th</sup> century DR.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/N%27Jast?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/N%27Jast?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCG-p160-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p160_1-6\">1.6</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Sims\" title=\"Chris Sims\">Chris Sims</a> (August 2008). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Guide</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Jennifer_Clarke_Wilkes\" title=\"Jennifer Clarke Wilkes\">Jennifer Clarke Wilkes</a>, <i>et al</i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 160. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4924-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4924-3\">978-0-7869-4924-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-RoF-p107-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-RoF-p107_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Matt_Forbeck\" title=\"Matt Forbeck\">Forbeck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/James_Jacobs\" title=\"James Jacobs\">Jacobs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_L._Boyd\" tit